@startuml wave004_signed_install_sequence
title Sequence A — Signed package install
actor App
participant Coordinator
participant SecurePackaging
participant Sandbox
participant Permissions

App -> Coordinator : install_signed_package(app_id)
Coordinator -> SecurePackaging : build_signed_app_package()
SecurePackaging --> Coordinator : signed manifest + verify
Coordinator -> Sandbox : create_profile(app_id)
Sandbox --> Coordinator : isolation profile
Coordinator -> Permissions : request(files_read)
Permissions --> Coordinator : allow/deny
Coordinator --> App : install result

@enduml
